&CONTROL OFF NOMSG
*
************************************************************
*   PASRUNM EXEC to run Pascal programs (MODULEs)
*   OPP - 06.2017
************************************************************
*
&IF .&1 EQ .? &GOTO -HELP
&IF .&1 EQ . &GOTO -NOFILE
&ANZ = &INDEX
*-----------------------------------------------------------
STATE &1 MODULE *
&IF &RETCODE EQ 0 &GOTO -OK1
&TYPE FILE &1 MODULE NOT FOUND
&END
&EXIT &RETCODE
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-OK1
&IF &INDEX LE 1 &GOTO -OK2
&IF &2 EQ ( &GOTO -RUNTONLY
&BEGTYPE
2ND PARM (BEFORE CMD LINE PARAMETERS) MUST BE A LEFT PARANTHESIS
SUB MODULES ARE NOT ALLOWED ON PASRUNM (USE PASRUN INSTEAD)
&END
&EXIT 99
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-RUNTONLY
&R1 = &3
&R2 = &4
&R3 = &5
&R4 = &6
&R5 = &7
&R6 = &8
&R7 = &9
&R8 = &10
&R9 = &11
&R10 = &12
&R11 = &13
&R12 = &14
&R13 = &15
&R14 = &16
&GOTO -OK2
*-----------------------------------------------------------
*
************************************************************
* FORTLIB NEEDED FOR MATH FUNCTIONS
* REPLACE FORTLIB WITH NAME OF YOUR FORTRAN G LIBRARY
* THE NAMES OF THE NEEDED (STANDARD) PASCAL RUNTIME
* LIBRARIES ARE ADDED VIA &STACK, &READ ARGS ETC.
* MORE MAY FOLLOW.
************************************************************
*
-OK2
FILEDEF QRD DISK &1 DBGINFO (RECFM F
XRUNPARM &1 &R1 &R2 &R3 &R4 &R5 &R6 &R7 &R8 &R9 &R10 &R11 &R12 &R13 &R14
&EXIT &RETCODE
*
************************************************************
* ALL SORT OF ERROR MESSAGES
************************************************************
*
-NOFILE
&TYPE MISSING FILE NAME - 1ST PARAM.
&GOTO -HELP
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-HELP
&BEGTYPE

USE THIS EXEC TO RUN A STANFORD PASCAL PROGRAM.
SPECIFY THE FILE NAME OF THE MODULE FILE CONTAINING THE
TRANSLATED PASCAL PROGRAM ON THE COMMAND LINE.
MORE OPTIONS:
SPECIFY RUNTIME PARAMETERS FOLLOWING A LEFT PARANTHESIS
E.G.: PASRUNM PPROG ( PARM1 PARM3 PARM3

&END
